abstract: >-
  This repository was created as part of the master thesis
  "Automated Composition and Benchmarking of Data Analysis
  Workflows in Computational Materials Science".

  The project includes a domain model for the defect
  formation energy workflow as well as implementations for
  the individual workflow steps. The model can be used to
  generate workflow candidates with the Automated Pipeline
  Explorer (APE). Additionally, workflows were chosen as
  benchmarking candidates.

  The candidates were benchmarked using consistency, defect
  formation energy, bulk modulus, lattice constant, peak
  memory and runtime as criteria.
